  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "갑작스럽겠지만\n사람을 찾는 걸 도와줬으면 해.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C791C2A4B7FDACA0C9C0B9CC000AC0ACB78CC7440020CC3EB2940020AC780020B3C4C640C92CC73CBA740020D574002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "찾고 있는 트레이너는\n드래캄이 파트너인 드래곤 조련사야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC3EACE00020C788B2940020D2B8B808C774B108B294000AB4DCB798CE84C7740020D30CD2B8B108C7780020B4DCB798ACE40020C870B828C0ACC57C002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키가 크고 머리는 녹색이었어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4AC000020D06CACE00020BA38B9ACB2940020B179C0C9C774C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고... 길거리 싸움꾼 같은\n와일드한 복장을 하고 있을 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE0002E002E002E0020AE38AC70B9AC0020C2F8C6C0AFBC0020AC19C740000AC640C77CB4DCD55C0020BCF5C7A5C7440020D558ACE00020C788C7440020AC70C57C002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금까지 말한 특징을 가진 인물로\n짐작 가는 사람이 있으면 가르쳐 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08AE4CC9C00020B9D0D55C0020D2B9C9D5C7440020AC00C9C40020C778BB3CB85C000AC9D0C7910020AC00B2940020C0ACB78CC7740020C788C73CBA740020AC00B974CCD00020C918002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사람을 찾는 걸 도와줘.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n드래캄이 파트너인\n드래곤 조련사야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n키가 크고 머리는 녹색에\n길거리 싸움꾼 같은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n와일드한 복장을 하고 있을 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭔데?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB54B370003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "복장이 그게 뭐야...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF5C7A5C7740020ADF8AC8C0020BB50C57C002E002E002E003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 뭘 입든 무슨 상관인데!\n무례하기는...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020BB580020C785B4E00020BB34C2A80020C0C1AD00C778B3700021000ABB34B840D558AE30B294002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고\n오랜만이야, 마샤.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0000AC624B79CB9CCC774C57C002C0020B9C8C0E4002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너를 이기기 위해\n나도 포켓몬도 열심히 단련해 왔어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B97C0020C774AE30AE300020C704D574000AB098B3C40020D3ECCF13BAACB3C40020C5F4C2ECD7880020B2E8B828D5740020C654C5B4002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단련하는 것은 파이터에게 당연한 일!\n나도 그 뒤로 더 강해졌다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8B828D558B2940020AC83C7400020D30CC774D130C5D0AC8C0020B2F9C5F0D55C0020C77C0021000AB098B3C40020ADF80020B4A4B85C0020B3540020AC15D574C84CB2E4ACE0002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번에야말로 너를 이겨서\n지난날의 약속을 지키게 하고 말겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D0C57CB9D0B85C0020B108B97C0020C774ACA8C11C000AC9C0B09CB0A0C7580020C57DC18DC7440020C9C0D0A4AC8C0020D558ACE00020B9D0ACA0C5B4002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시온?\n재미있어 보이니까 나도 낄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC628003F000AC7ACBBF8C788C5B40020BCF4C774B2C8AE4C0020B098B3C40020B084AC8C002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네에...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124C5D0002E002E002E003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 승부를 방해하지 마!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020C2B9BD80B97C0020BC29D574D558C9C00020B9C8002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시온과 싸우시려면\n제 허락이 있어야 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC628ACFC0020C2F8C6B0C2DCB824BA74000AC81C0020D5C8B77DC7740020C788C5B4C57C0020D574C694002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기서 당신이 선택할 수 있는 건 단 하나!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님과 팀을 맺고\n우리와 싸우는 것뿐이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C11C0020B2F9C2E0C7740020C120D0DDD5600020C2180020C788B2940020AC740020B2E80020D558B098002100100001BE01000A00100002010000000020B2D8ACFC0020D300C7440020B9FAACE0000AC6B0B9ACC6400020C2F8C6B0B2940020AC83BFD0C774C5D0C694002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모두를 이끄는 것이\n우리 셀럽의 사명이에요, 픽시!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8B450B97C0020C774B044B2940020AC83C774000AC6B0B9AC0020C140B7FDC7580020C0ACBA85C774C5D0C694002C0020D53DC2DC002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 비장의 카드!\n드래캄! 메가진화로 날뛰어 보자고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020BE44C7A5C7580020CE74B4DC0021000AB4DCB798CE8400210020BA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020B0A0B6F0C5B40020BCF4C790ACE0002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단련했다는 말이\n거짓은 아니었나 보네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8B828D588B2E4B2940020B9D0C774000AAC70C9D3C7400020C544B2C8C5C8B0980020BCF4B124002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이지! 그렇지만 이번에 승리한 건\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>의 도움이 있어서야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C9C000210020ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C774BC88C5D00020C2B9B9ACD55C0020AC74000A0010000201000000C7580020B3C4C6C0C7740020C788C5B4C11CC57C002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 승리는 승리니까\n전에 했던 약속을 지켜 줘야겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C2B9B9ACB2940020C2B9B9ACB2C8AE4C000AC804C5D00020D588B3580020C57DC18DC7440020C9C0CF1C0020C918C57CACA0C5B4002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시온, 내 파트너가 되어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCC628002C0020B0B40020D30CD2B8B108AC000020B418C5B40020C918002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 말이지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나한테는 이미 파트너가 있어서 말이야.\n약속을 못 지켜서 미안...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098D55CD14CB2940020C774BBF80020D30CD2B8B108AC000020C788C5B4C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E000AC57DC18DC7440020BABB0020C9C0CF1CC11C0020BBF8C548002E002E002E002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무쿠 님이랑 팀을 맺을 때는\n별말 없었으면서...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34CFE00020B2D8C774B7910020D300C7440020B9FAC7440020B54CB294000ABCC4B9D00020C5C6C5C8C73CBA74C11C002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그, 그건...\n안샤 님 일 때문에...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8002C0020ADF8AC74002E002E002E000AC548C0E40020B2D80020C77C0020B54CBB38C5D0002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나... 단련하는 데 너무 오래 걸려서\n기회를 놓쳐 버린 모양이네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB098002E002E002E0020B2E8B828D558B2940020B3700020B108BB340020C624B7980020AC78B824C11C000AAE30D68CB97C0020B193CCD00020BC84B9B00020BAA8C591C774B124002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알았어.\n시온... 지금 모습도 잘 어울려.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CC558C5B4002E000AC2DCC628002E002E002E0020C9C0AE080020BAA8C2B5B3C40020C7980020C5B4C6B8B824002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n너도 여러모로 고마웠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AB108B3C40020C5ECB7ECBAA8B85C0020ACE0B9C8C6E0C5B4002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아~\n파트너로 삼을 괜찮은 사람 어디 없나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544007E000AD30CD2B8B108B85C0020C0BCC7440020AD1CCC2EC7400020C0ACB78C0020C5B4B5140020C5C6B098003F00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "늘 전장에 있다는 마음가짐으로\n언제든 싸울 준비가 되어 있고,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n믿을 수 있는 파트너가 있으면 좋겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2980020C804C7A5C5D00020C788B2E4B2940020B9C8C74CAC00C9D0C73CB85C000AC5B8C81CB4E00020C2F8C6B80020C900BE44AC000020B418C5B40020C788ACE0002C00100001BE00000ABBFFC7440020C2180020C788B2940020D30CD2B8B108AC000020C788C73CBA740020C88BACA0C5B4002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    }
